#: kprintdialog.cpp:97
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Printer Location:</b> The <em>Location</em> may describe where the "
"selected printer is located. The Location description is created by the "
"administrator of the print system (or may be left empty). </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Drukker Ligging:</b> Die <em>Ligging</em> kan beskryf waar die gekose "
"drukker geleë is. Die ligging beskrywing is geskep deur die administrateur van "
"die druk stelsel (of kan leeg gelos word).</qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:102
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Printer Type:</b>  The <em>Type</em> indicates your printer type. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Drukker Tipe:</b> Die <em>Tipe</em>dui jou tipe drukker aan. </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:104
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Printer State:</b>  The <em>State</em> indicates the state of the print "
"queue on the print server (which could be your localhost). The state may be "
"'Idle', 'Processing', 'Stopped', 'Paused' or similar. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Drukker Status:</b> Die <em>Status</em>dui die status van die drukker "
"tou op die drukker bediener (wat jou plaaslike gasheer kan wees) aan.  Die "
"status kan wees 'Luier', 'Verwerk', 'Gestop', 'Wag' of soorgelyk . </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:108
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Printer Comment:</b>  The <em>Comment</em> may describe the selected "
"printer. This comment is created by the administrator of the print system (or "
"may be left empty). </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Drukker Kommentaar:</b>  Die <em>Kommentaar</em> "
"kan die gekose drukker beskryf. Hierdie kommentaar is geskep deur die "
"administrateur van die druk stelsel (of kan leeg gelos word). </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:112
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Printer Selection Menu:</b>  "
"<p>Use this combo box to select the printer to which you want to print. "
"Initially (if you run KDEPrint for the first time), you may only find the   <em>"
"KDE special printers</em> (which save jobs to disk [as PostScript- or "
"PDF-files], or deliver jobs via email (as a PDF attachment). If you are missing "
"a real printer, you need to... "
"<ul> "
"<li>...either create a local printer with the help of the <em>"
"KDE Add Printer Wizard</em>. The Wizard is available for the CUPS and RLPR "
"printing systems (click button to the left of the <em>'Properties'</em> "
"button),</li> "
"<li>...or try to connect to an existing remote CUPS print server. You can "
"connect by clicking the <em>'System Options'</em> button below. A new dialog "
"opens: click on the <em>'CUPS server'</em> icon: Fill in the information "
"required to use the remote server. </li>  </ul> "
"<p><b>Note:</b> It may happen that you successfully connected to a remote CUPS  "
"server and still do not get a printer list. If this happens: force KDEPrint to  "
"re-load its configuration files. To reload the configuration files, either "
"start kprinter again, or use the  switch the print system away from CUPS and "
"back again once. The print system switch  can be made through a selection in "
"the drop-down menu at bottom of this dialog when  fully expanded). </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Drukker Kieslys:</b>  "
"<p>Gebruik hierdie kombo boks om die printer te kies waarheen jy wil druk. "
"Oorspronklik (wanneer jy KDEDruk vir die eerste keer hardloop), kan jy dalk "
"slegs die <em> KDE spesiale drukkers vind</em> (wat take stoor na disket [as "
"Naskrif- of PDF-lêers], of take aflewer via e-pos (as 'n PDF aanhangsel). "
"Indien jy 'n regte drukker vermis, moet jy ... "
"<ul> "
"<li>...óf 'n plaaslike drukker skep met die hulp van die <em>"
"KDE Voeg Drukker By Slimmerd</em>.  Die Slimmerd is beskikbaar vir die CUPS en "
"RLPR druk stelsels (kliek knoppie aan die linkerkant van die <em> "
"'Eienskappe'</em> knoppie),</li> "
"<li>...óf probeer om te konnekteer aan 'n bestaande afstand CUPS drukker "
"bediener. Jy kan konnekteer deur die <em>'Stelsel Opsies'</em> "
"knoppie onder te kliek. 'n Nuwe dialoog maak oop: kliek op die <em>"
"'CUPS Bediener'</em> ikoon:  Vul die inligting in wat vereis word om die "
"afstand bediener te gebruik. </li> </ul> "
"<p><b>Nota:</b> Dit kan gebeur dat jy suksesvol konnekteer aan 'n afstand CUPS "
"bediener en steeds nie 'n drukkerslys kry nie. As dit gebeur:  forseer KDEDruk "
"om sy konfigurasie lêers te herlaai. Om die konfigurasie lêers te herlaai, "
"begin óf KDrukker weer, óf gebruik die skakelaar om die druk stelsel weg te "
"skakel van CUPS en dan weer terug te skakel, een keer. Die druk stelsel "
"skakelaar kan gemaak word deur 'n seleksie in die aftuimel kieslys aan die "
"onderkant van hierdie dialoog wanneer dit ten volle uitgebrei is). </p> </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:137
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Print Job Properties:</b>  "
"<p>This button opens a dialog where you can make decisions regarding all "
"supported print job options. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Druk Taak Eienskappe:</b>  "
"<p>/Hierdie knoppie maak 'n dialoog oop waar jy besluite kan maak rakende alle "
"ondersteunde druk taak opsies. </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:141
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Selective View on List of Printers:</b> "
"<p> This button reduces the list of visible printers to a shorter, more "
"convenient, pre-defined list.</p> "
"<p>This is particularly useful in enterprise environments with lots of "
"printers. The default is to show <b>all</b> printers.</p> "
"<p>To create a personal <em>'selective view list'</em>, click on the <em>"
"'System Options'</em> button at the bottom of this dialog. Then, in the new "
"dialog, select <em>'Filter'</em> (left column in the <em>"
"KDE Print Configuration</em> dialog) and setup your selection..</p> "
"<p><b>Warning:</b> Clicking this button without prior creation of a personal  "
"<em>'selective view list'</em> will make all printers dissappear from the  "
"view. (To re-enable all printers, just click this button again.) </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Selektiewe Uitkyk op Lys van Drukkers:</b> "
"<p>Hierdie knoppie verminder die lys van sigbare drukkers tot 'n korter, meer "
"handige, vooraf bepaalde lys.</p> "
"<p>Hierdie is spesifiek nutting in ondernemingsomgewing met baie drukkers. Die "
"verstek is om <b>alle</b> drukkers te wys.</p> "
"<p>Om 'n persoonlike <em>'selektiewe uitkyk lys'</em> te skep, kliek op die <em>"
"'Stelel Opsies'</em> knoppie aan die einde van hierdie dialoog. Dan, in die "
"nuwe dialoog, kies <em>'Filtreer'</em> (linker kolom in die<em>"
"KDE Druk Konfigurasie</em> dialoog) en stel jou seleksie op..</p> "
"<p><b>Waarskuwing:</b> Die kliek van hierdie knoppie sonder die vooraf skepping "
"van 'n persoonlike  <em>'selektiewe uitkyk lys'</em> "
"sal alle drukkers laat verdwyn vanaf die uitkyk. (Om alle drukkers her instaat "
"te stel, kliek net hierdie knoppie weer.) </p>  </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:154
msgid ""
"<qt><b>KDE Add Printer Wizard</b> "
"<p>This button starts the <em>KDE Add Printer Wizard</em>.</p> "
"<p>Use the Wizard (with <em>\"CUPS\"</em> or <em>\"RLPR\"</em>"
") to add locally defined printers to your system. </p> "
"<p><b>Note:</b> The <em>KDE Add Printer Wizard</em> does <b>not</b> "
"work,  and this button is disabled if you use  <em>\"Generic LPD</em>\", <em>"
"\"LPRng\"</em>, or <em>\"Print Through  an External Program</em>\".) </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>KDE Voeg Drukker By Slimmerd</b> "
"<p>Hierdie knoppie begin die <em>KDE Voeg Drukker By Slimmerd</em>.</p> "
"<p>Gebruik die Slimmerd (met <em>\"CUPS\"</em> of <em>\"RLPR\"</em>"
") om plaaslike gedefinieerde drukkers tot jou stelsel by te voeg. </p> "
"<p><b>Nota:</b> Die <em>KDE Voeg Drukker By Slimmerd</em> werk <b>nie</b>"
", en hierdie knoppie is onaktief as jy <em>\"Generiese LPD</em>\", <em>"
"\"LPRng\"</em>, gebruik of <em>\"Druk deur 'n Eksterne Program</em>\".) </p>  "
"</qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:163
msgid ""
" <qt><b>External Print Command</b> "
"<p>Here you can enter any command that would also print for you in  a <em>"
"konsole</em> window. </p> <b>Example:</b> "
"<pre>a2ps -P &lt;printername&gt; --medium=A3</pre>. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Eksterne Druk Opdrag</b> "
"<p>Hier kan jy enige opdrag invoer wat ook vir jou in 'n<em>konsole</em> "
"venster. </p> <b>Voorbeeld:</b> "
"<pre>a2ps -P &lt;drukkernaam&gt; --medium=A3</pre>. </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:168
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Additional Print Job Options</b> "
"<p>This button shows or hides additional printing options.</qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Addisionele Druk Taak Opsies</b> "
"<p>Hierdie knoppie wys of verskans addisionele druk opsies.</qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:170
msgid ""
" <qt><b>System Options:</b>  "
"<p>This button starts a new dialog where you can adjust various settings of "
"your printing system. Amongst them: "
"<ul>"
"<li> Should KDE applications embed all fonts into the PostScript they generate "
"for printing? "
"<li> Should KDE use an external PostScript viewer like <em>gv</em> "
"for print page previews? "
"<li> Should KDEPrint use a local or a remote CUPS server?, </ul> "
"and many more....  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Stelsel Opsies:</b>  "
"<p>Hierdie knoppie begin 'n nuwe dialoog waar jy verskeie instellings van jou "
"druk stelsel kan aanpas. Tussen hulle: "
"<ul>"
"<li> Moet KDE toepassings alle skrif tipes verskans in die Naskrif wat hulle "
"genereer om te druk? "
"<li> Moet KDE 'n eksterne  Naskrif kyker gebruik soos <em>gv</em> "
"vir die druk van bladsy voorskoue? "
"<li> Moet KDEDruk 'n plaaslike of 'n afgeleë CUPS bediener gebruik?, </ul> "
"en baie meer....  </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:182
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Help:</b> This button takes you to the complete <em>KDEPrint Manual</em>"
". </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Help:</b> Hierdie knoppie neem jou om te voltooi <em>"
"KDEPrint Handleidung</em>. </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:186
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Cancel:</b> This button cancels your print job and quits the kprinter "
"dialog. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Kanseleer:</b> Hierdie knoppie kanseleer jou druk werk en verlaat die "
"kdrukker dialoog. </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:190
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Print:</b> This button sends the job to the printing process. If you "
"are sending non-PostScript files, you may be asked if you want KDE to convert "
"the files into PostScript, or if you want your print subsystem (like CUPS) to "
"do this. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Druk:</b> Hierdie knoppie stuur die taak na die durk proses. As jy "
"nie-Naskrif lêers stuur, kan jy gevra owrd of jy wil hê dat KDE die lêers moet "
"omskakel na Naskrif, en of jy jou druk substelsel (soos CUPS) wil hê om dit te "
"doen. </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:196
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Keep Printing Dialog Open</b>"
"<p>If you enable this checkbox, the printing dialog stays open after you hit "
"the <em>Print</em> button.</p> "
"<p> This is especially useful, if you need to test various print settings (like "
"color matching for an inkjet printer) or if you want to send your job to "
"multiple printers (one after the other) to have it finished more quickly.</p> "
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Hou Druk Dialoog Oop</b>"
"<p>As jy hierdie kiesboks aktiveer, bly die druk dialoog oop nadat jy die <em>"
"Druk</em> knoppie gedruk het.</p> "
"<p> Dit is veral gerieflik wanneer jy nodig het om verskeie druk instellings "
"(soos kleurpas vir 'n instraal drukker) te toets of as jy jou taak wil stuur na "
"veelvoudige drukkers (een na die ander) om dit vinniger klaar te kry.</p> </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:206
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Output File Name and Path:</b> The \"Output file:\" shows  you where "
"your file will be saved if you decide to \"Print to File\" your job, using one "
"of the KDE <em>Special Printers</em> named \"Print to File (PostScript)\" or "
"\"Print to File (PDF)\". Choose a name and location that suits your need by "
"using the button and/or editing the line on the right. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Uitset Lêer Naam en Pad:</b> Die \"Uitset lêer:\" wys jou waar jou lêer "
"gestoor sal word as jy besluit om jou taak te \"Druk na Lêer\", deur gebruik te "
"maak van een van die KDE <em>Spesiale Drukkers</em> genaamd \"Druk na Lêer "
"(Naskrif)\" of \"Druk na Lêer (PDF)\". Kies 'n naam en ligging wat jou "
"behoeftes pas deur gebruik te maak van die knoppie en/of die lyn aan die "
"regterkant aan te wysig. </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:214
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Output File Name and Path:</b> Edit this line to create a  path and "
"filename that suits your needs. (Button and Lineedit field are only available "
"if you \"Print to File\") </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Uitset Lêer Naam en Pad:</b> Wysig hirdie lyne om 'n pad en lêernaam te "
"skep wat jou behoeftes pas.  (Knoppie en Lyn wysiging veld slegs beskikbaar as "
"jy \"Druk na Lêer\") </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:219
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Browse Directories button:<b> This button calls  the \"File Open / "
"Browsed Directories\" dialog to let you choose a directory and file name where "
"your \"Print-to-File\" job should be saved. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Blaai Gidse knoppie:<b> Hierdie knoppie roep die \"Lêer Open / "
"Geblaaide Gidse\" dialoog om jou 'n gids en lêernaam te laat kies waar jou "
"\"Druk-na-Lêer\" taak gestoor moet word. </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:225
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Add File to Job</b> "
"<p>This button calls the \"File Open / Browse Directories\" dialog to allow you "
"to select a file for printing. Note, that  "
"<ul>"
"<li>you can select ASCII or International Text, PDF, PostScript, JPEG, TIFF, "
"PNG, GIF and many other graphical formats. "
"<li>you can select various files from different paths and send them as one "
"\"multi-file job\" to the printing system. </ul> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Voeg Lêer by Taak</b> "
"<p>Hierdie knoppie roep die \"Lêer Open / Blaaik Gidse\" dialoog om jou toe te "
"laat om 'n lêer te kies om gedruk te word. Let daarop dat "
"<ul>"
"<li> jy kan ASCII kies of Internationale Teks, PDF, Naskrif, JPEG, TIFF, PNG, "
"GIF en baie ander grafiese formate. "
"<li>jy kan verskeie lêers kies van verskillende roetes en hulle stuur na die "
"druk stelsle as een \"multi-lêer taak\". </ul> </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:237
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Print Preview</b> Enable this checkbox if you want to see a preview of "
"your printout. A preview lets you check if, for instance, your intended "
"\"poster\" or \"pamphlet\" layout looks like you expected, without wasting "
"paper first. It also lets you cancel the job if something looks wrong.  "
"<p><b>Note:</b> The preview feature (and therefore this checkbox)  is only "
"visible for printjobs created from inside KDE applications.  If you start "
"kprinter from the commandline, or if you use kprinter  as a print command for "
"non-KDE applications (like Acrobat Reader,  Firefox or OpenOffice), print "
"preview is not available here.  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Druk Voorskou</b> Aktiveer hierdie kiesboks as jy 'n voorskou wil sien "
"van jou uitdruk. 'n Voorskou laat jou kyk of, byvoorbeeld, jou bedoelde "
"\"plakaat\" of \"pamflet\" uitleg lyk soos jy verwag het, sonder om eers papier "
"te mors. Dit laat jou ook toe om die taak te kanselleer as iets verkeerd lyk. "
"<p><b>Nota:</b> Die voorskou eienskap (en daarom hierdie kiesboks) is slegs "
"sigbaar vir druk take wat binne KDE toepassings geskep is. As jy kdrukker begin "
"van die opdraglyn, of as jy kdrukker gebruik as 'n druk opdrag vir nie-KDE "
"toepassings (soos Acrobat Readre, Firefox of OpenOffice), is drukvoorskou nie "
"hier beskikbaar nie.  </qt>"

#: kprintdialog.cpp:250
msgid ""
" <qt><b>Set as Default Printer</b> This button sets the current printer as the "
"user's default.  "
"<p><b>Note:</b> (Button is only visible if the checkbox for  <em>"
"System Options</em> --> <em>General</em> --> <em>Miscellaneous</em>: <em>"
"\"Defaults to the last printer used in the application\"</em> "
"is disabled.) </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><b>Stel as Verstek Drukker</b>  Hierdie knoppie stel die huidige drukker "
"as die gebruiker se verstek.  "
"<p><b>Nota:</b> (Knoppie is slegs sigbaar as die kiesboks vir <em>"
"Stelsel Opsies</em> --> <em>Algemeen</em> --> <em>Verskeie</em>: <em>"
"\"Verstek van die laaste drukker gebruik in die toepassing\"</em> "
"onaktief is.) </qt>"

