#: cups/kptagspage.cpp:36
msgid ""
" <qt>"
"<p><b>Additional Tags</b></p> You may send additional commands to the CUPS "
"server via this editable list.  There are 3 purposes for this: "
"<ul> "
"<li>Use any current or future standard CUPS job option not supported by the  "
"KDEPrint GUI. </li> "
"<li>Control any custom job option you may want to support in custom CUPS "
"filters  and backends plugged into the CUPS filtering chain.</li>  "
"<li>Send short messages to the operators of your production printers in your  "
"<em>Central Repro Department</em>. </ul>  "
"<p><b>Standard CUPS job options:</b> A complete list of standard CUPS job  "
"options is in the <a href=\"http://localhost:631/sum.html\">CUPS User Manual</a>"
".  Mappings of the kprinter user interface widgets to respective CUPS job "
"option  names are named in the various <em>WhatsThis</em> help items..</p> "
"<p><b>Custom CUPS job options:</b> CUPS print servers may be customized with "
"additional  print filters and backends which understand custom job options. You "
"can specify such  custom job options here. If in doubt, ask your system "
"administrator..</p> "
"<p><b> </b></p> "
"<p><b>Operator Messages:</b> You may send additional messages to the "
"operator(s) of your production printers (e.g. in your <em>"
"Central Repro Department</p>) Messages can be read by the operator(s) (or "
"yourself) by viewing the <em>\"Job IPP Report\"</em> for the job.</p> <b>"
"Examples:</b>"
"<br> "
"<pre> A standard CUPS job option:"
"<br>    <em>(Name) number-up</em>                -- <em>(Value) 9</em>                     "
"<br> "
"<br> A job option for custom CUPS filters or backends:"
"<br>    <em>(Name) DANKA_watermark</em>          -- <em>"
"(Value) Company_Confidential</em>   "
"<br> "
"<br> A message to the operator(s):"
"<br>    <em>(Name) Deliver_after_completion</em> -- <em>"
"(Value) to_Marketing_Departm.</em>"
"<br> </pre> "
"<p><b>Note:</b> the fields must not include spaces, tabs or quotes. You may "
"need to  double-click on a field to edit it. "
"<p><b>Warning:</b> Do not use such standard CUPS option names which also can be "
"used  through the KDEPrint GUI. Results may be  unpredictable if they conflict, "
" or if they are sent multiple times. For all options supported by the GUI, "
"please do use  the GUI. (Each GUI element's  'WhatsThis' names the related CUPS "
"option name.) </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>"
"<p><b>Addisionele Etikette</b></p>Jy mag addisionele opdragte stuur na die CUPS "
"bediener via hierdie redigeerbare lys. Daar is 3 doele daarvoor: "
"<ul> "
"<li>Gebruik enige huidige of toekomstige standaard CUPS taak opsie wat nie "
"ondersteun word deur die KDEDruk GUI nie. </li> "
"<li>Beheer enige gebruiklike taak opsie wat jy sal wil ondersteun in "
"gebruiklike CUPS filtreerders en agtergronde wat ingeprop is in die CUPS "
"filtreringsketting.</li>  "
"<li>Stuur kort boodskappe aan die operateurs van jou produksie drukkers in jou "
"<em>Sentrale Repro Departement</em>. </ul>  "
"<p><b>Standaard CUPS taak opsies:</b> 'n Volledige lys van standaard CUPS taak "
"opsies is in die <a href=\"http://localhost:631/sum.html\">"
"CUPS gebruikershandleidingl</a>. Kaarterings van die kdrukker gebruiker "
"koppelvlak widgets aan onderskeie CUPS taak opsiename is benoem in die verskeie "
"<em>WatisDit</em> help items..</p> "
"<p><b>Gebruiklike CUPS taak opsies: CUPS druk bedieners mag pasgemaak wees met "
"addisionele druk filtreerders en agtergronde wat gebruiklike taak opsies "
"verstaan. Jy kan sodanige gebruiklike taal opsies hier spesifiseer. Indien jy "
"twyfel, vra jou sisteem administrateur..</p> "
"<p><b> </b></p> "
"<p><b>Operateurs Boodskappe:</b> Jy mag addisionele boodskappe na die "
"operateur(s) van jou produksie drukkers stuur (bv. in jou <em>"
"Sentrale Repro Departement</p>) Boodskappe kan gelees word deur die "
"operateur(s) (of jyself) deur die <em>\"Taak IPP Verslag\"</em> "
"vir die taak te lees.</p> <b>Voorbeelde:</b>"
"<br> "
"<pre> 'n Standaard CUPS taak opsie:"
"<br>    <em>(Naam) nomer-op</em>                -- <em>(Waarde) 9</em>                     "
"<br> "
"<br>'n Taak opsie vir gebruiklike CUPS filtreerders of agtergronde:"
"<br>    <em>(Naam) DANKA_watermerk</em>          -- <em>"
"(Waarde) Maatskappy_Konfidensieël</em>   "
"<br> "
"<br> 'n Boodskap aan die operater(s):"
"<br>    <em>(Naam) Lewer_af_na_voltooiing</em> -- <em>"
"(Waarde) aan_Bemarking_Departm.</em>"
"<br> </pre> "
"<p><b>Nota:</b> die velde moet nie spasies, oortjies of aanhalings insluit nie. "
"Jy mag nodig hê om op 'n veld te dubbel kliek om dit te redigeer. "
"<p><b>Waarskuwing:</b> Moet nie sodanige standaard CUPS opsie name gebruik wat "
"ook gebruik kan word deur die KDEDruk GUI. Resultate kan onvoorspelbaar wees as "
"hulle in konflik kom, of as hulle veelvuldige kere gestuur word. Vir alle "
"opsies wat deur die GUI ondersteuen word, gebruik asseblief die GUI. (Elke GUI "
"element se  'WatisDit' benoem  die verwante CUPS opsie naam.) </p>  </qt> "

