#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:44
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Brightness:</b> Slider to control the brightness value of all colors "
"used.</p> "
"<p> The brightness value can range from 0 to 200. Values greater than 100 will  "
"lighten the print. Values less than 100 will darken the print. </p>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element "
"matches  with the CUPS commandline job option parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o brightness=...      # use range from \"0\" to \"200\"  </pre>  </p>  "
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Helderheid:</b> Glyer om die helderheid waarde van alle gebruikte kleure "
"te beheer.</p> "
"<p> Die helderheidswaarde kan varieer van  0 tot 200. Waardes groter as 100 sal "
"die druk ligter maak. Waardes kleinder as 100 sal die druk donkerder maak. </p>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Addisionele wenk vir krag gebruikers:</b> Hierdie KDEDruk GUI element "
"stem ooreen met die CUPS opdraglyn taak opsie parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o helderheid=...      # gebruik reek van \"0\" tot \"200\"  </pre>  "
"</p>  </qt>"

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:58
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Hue (Tint):</b> Slider to control the hue value for color rotation.</p> "
"<p> The hue value is a number from -360 to 360 and represents the color hue "
"rotation.  The following table summarizes the change you will see for the base "
"colors:  "
"<center>  <table border=\"1\" width=\"70%\">  "
"<tr>"
"<th><b>Original</b></th> "
"<th><b>hue=-45</b></th> "
"<th><b>hue=45</b></th>   </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Red</td>             "
"<td>Purple</td>         "
"<td>Yellow-orange</td>   </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Green</td>           "
"<td>Yellow-green</td>   "
"<td>Blue-green</td>      </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Yellow</td>          "
"<td>Orange</td>         "
"<td>Green-yellow</td>    </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Blue</td>            "
"<td>Sky-blue</td>       "
"<td>Purple</td>          </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Magenta</td>         "
"<td>Indigo</td>         "
"<td>Crimson</td>         </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Cyan</td>            "
"<td>Blue-green</td>     "
"<td>Light-navy-blue</td> </tr>  </table>  </center>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element "
"matches  with the CUPS commandline job option parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o hue=...     # use range from \"-360\" to \"360\"  </pre> </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Skakering (Kleur): Glyer om die skakering waarde vir kleur rotasie te "
"beheer. Die skakering waarde is 'n getal van -360 tot 360 en verteenwoordig die "
"kleur skakering rotasie. Die volgende tabel som die verandering op wat jy sal "
"sien vir die basis kleure: <sentreer>  <tabel raam=\"1\" wydte=\"70%\">  "
"<tr>"
"<th><b>Oorspronklikl</b></th> "
"<th><b>skakering=-45</b></th> "
"<th><b>skakering=45</b></th>   </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Rooi</td>             "
"<td>Pers</td>         "
"<td>Geel-oranje</td>   </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Groen</td>           "
"<td>Geel-groen</td>   "
"<td>Blou-groen</td>      </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Geel</td>          "
"<td>Oranje</td>         "
"<td>Groen-geel</td>    </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Blou</td>            "
"<td>Hemel-blou</td>       "
"<td>Pers</td>          </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Magenta</td>         "
"<td>Indigo</td>         "
"<td>Crimson</td>         </tr>  "
"<tr>"
"<td>Cyan</td>            "
"<td>Blou-groen</td>     "
"<td>Ligte-vlootblou</td> </tr>  </tabel>  </sentreer>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Addisionele wenk vir krag gebruikers:</b> Hierdie KDEDruk GUI element "
"stem ooreen met die CUPS opdraglyn taak opsie parameter: -o skakering=. . . # "
"gebruik reeks van \"-360\" tot \"360\"   </pre> </p>  </qt>"

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:83
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Saturation:</b> Slider to control the saturation value for all colors "
"used.</p> "
"<p> The saturation value adjusts the saturation of the colors in an image, "
"similar to  the color knob on your television. The color saturation value.can "
"range from 0 to 200. On inkjet printers, a higher saturation value uses more "
"ink. On laserjet printers, a  higher saturation uses more toner.  A color "
"saturation of 0 produces a black-and-white print, while a value of 200 will  "
"make the colors extremely intense. </p> "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element "
"matches  with the CUPS commandline job option parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o saturation=...      # use range from \"0\" to \"200\"  </pre> </p>  "
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Saturasie</b> Glyer om die saturasie waarde van alle gebruikte kleure te "
"beheer.</p> "
"<p> Die saturasie waarde verstel die saturasie van die kleure in 'n prent, "
"soortgelyk aan die kleur knop op jou televisie  Die kleur saturasie waarde kan "
"wissel van 0 tot 200.  Op inkstraal drukkers, gebruik 'n hoër saturasie waarde "
"meer ink.  Op laserjet drukkers, gebruik 'n hoër saturasie meer toner.  'n "
"Kleur saturasie van 0 produseer a swart-en-wit druk, terwyl 'n waarde van 200 "
"die kleuer geweldig intens sal maak. </p> "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Addisionele wenk vir krag gebruikers:</b> Hierdie KDEDRuk GUI element "
"stem ooreen met die CUPS opdraglyn taak opsie parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o saturasie=...      # gebruik reeks van \"0\" tot \"200\"  </pre> "
"</p>  </qt>"

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:101
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Gamma:</b> Slider to control the gamma value for color correction.</p> "
"<p> The gamma value can range from 1 to 3000.  A gamma values greater than 1000 "
"lightens the print. A gamma value less than 1000  darken the print. The default "
"gamma is 1000. </p> "
"<p><b>Note:</b></p> the gamma value adjustment is not visible in the thumbnail  "
"preview. </p>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element "
"matches  with the CUPS commandline job option parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o gamma=...      # use range from \"1\" to \"3000\"  </pre> </p>  "
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Gamma:</b> Glyer o die gamma waarde vir kleur korreksie te beheer.</p> "
"<p> Die gamma waarde kan wissel van 1 tot 3000.  'n Gamma waarde grote as 1000 "
"maak die druk ligter.  'n Gamma waarde kleiner as 1000 maak die druk donkerder. "
" Die verstek gamma is 1000. </p> "
"<p><b>Nota:</b></p> die gamma waarde aanpassing is nie sigbaar in die "
"duimnaelskets voorskou nie. </p>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Addisionele wenk vir krag gebruikers:</b> Hierdie KDEDruk GUI element "
"stem ooreen met die CUPS opdrag lyn taak opsie parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o gamma=...      # gebruik reeks van \"1\" tot \"3000\"  </pre> </p>  "
"</qt>"

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:118
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Image Printing Options</b></p>  "
"<p>All options controlled on this page only apply to printing images.  Most "
"image file formats are supported. To name a few: JPEG, TIFF, PNG, GIF,  PNM "
"(PBM/PGM/PNM/PPM), Sun Raster, SGI RGB, Windows BMP. Options to influence color "
"output of image printouts are:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> Brightness  </li> "
"<li> Hue         </li> "
"<li> Saturation  </li> "
"<li> Gamma       </li> </ul>  "
"<p>For a more detailed explanation about Brightness, Hue, Saturation and Gamma "
"settings, please  look at the 'WhatsThis' items provided for these controls.  "
"</p>  </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Beeld Druk Opsies</b></p>  "
"<p>Alle opsies wat op hierdie bladsy beheer word is slegs van toepassing op die "
"druk van beelde. Meeste beeld lêer formate word ondersteun. Om 'n paar te noem: "
" JPEG, TIFF, PNG, GIF, PNM (PBM/PGM/PNM/PPM), Sun Raster, SGI RGB, Windows BMP. "
"Opsies om kleur uitset van beeld uitdrukke te beïnvloed is:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> Helderheid  </li> "
"<li> Skakering         </li> "
"<li> Saturasie  </li> "
"<li> Gamma       </li> </ul>  "
"<p>Vir 'n meer gedetailleerde verduideliking omtrent Helderheid, Skakering, "
"Saturasie en Gamma instellings, kyk asseblief na die 'WatisDit' items wat "
"voorsien word vir hierdie kontroles.  </p>  </p>  </qt>"

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:136
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Coloration Preview Thumbnail</b></p>  "
"<p>The coloration preview thumbnail indicates change of image coloration by "
"different settings.  Options to influence output are:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> Brightness  </li> "
"<li> Hue (Tint)  </li> "
"<li> Saturation  </li> "
"<li> Gamma       </li> </ul>  </p>  "
"<p>For a more detailed explanation about Brightness, Hue, Saturation and Gamma "
"settings, please  look at the 'WhatsThis' items provided for these controls.  "
"</p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Skaduwee Voorskou Duimnaelskets</b></p>  "
"<p>Die skaduwee voorskou duimnaelskets dui verandering van beeld skaduwee deur "
"verskillende instellings aan. Opsies om uitset te beïnvloed is:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li>Helderheid </li> "
"<li> Skakering (Tint)  </li> "
"<li> Saturasie  </li> "
"<li> Gamma       </li> </ul>  </p>  "
"<p>Vir 'n meer gedetailleerde verduideliking omtrent Helderheid, Skakering, "
"Saturasie en Gamma instellings, kyk asseblief na die 'WatisDit' items wat "
"voorsien word vir hierdie kontroles.  </p>  </qt>"

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:152
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Image Size:</b> Dropdown menu to control the image size on the printed "
"paper. Dropdown  works in conjunction with slider below. Dropdown options "
"are:.</p> "
"<ul>  "
"<li> <b>Natural Image Size:</b> Image prints in its natural image size. If it "
"does not fit onto  one sheet, the printout will be spread across multiple "
"sheets. Note, that the slider is disabled  when selecting 'natural image size' "
"in the dropdown menu. </li> "
"<li> <b>Resolution (ppi):</b> The resolution value slider covers a number range "
"from 1 to 1200.  It specifies the resolution of the image in Pixels Per Inch "
"(PPI). An image that is 3000x2400 pixels  will print 10x8 inches at 300 pixels "
"per inch, for example, but 5x4 inches at 600 pixels per inch. If the specified "
"resolution makes the image larger than the page, multiple pages will be "
"printed.  Resolution defaults to 72 ppi.  </li> "
"<li> <b>% of Page Size:</b> The percent value slider covers numbers from 1 to "
"800. It specifies the size  in relation to the page (not the image). A scaling "
"of 100 percent will fill the page as completely  as the image aspect ratio "
"allows (doing auto-rotation of the image as needed).  A scaling of more than "
"100 will print the image across multiple  sheets. A scaling of 200 percent will "
"print on up to 4 pages. </li> Scaling in % of page size defaults to 100 %.  "
"<li> <b>% of Natural Image Size:</b> The percent value slider moves from 1 to "
"800. It specifies  the printout size in relation  to the natural image size. A "
"scaling of 100 percent will print the image at its natural size, while a  "
"scaling of 50 percent will print the image at half its natural size. If the "
"specified scaling makes  the image larger than the page, multiple pages will be "
"printed.  Scaling in % of natural image size defaults to 100 %.  </ul>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element "
"matches  with the CUPS commandline job option parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>     -o natural-scaling=...     # range in  %  is 1....800  "
"<br>     -o scaling=...             # range in  %  is 1....800  "
"<br>     -o ppi=...                 # range in ppi is 1...1200  </pre> </p>  "
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Beeld Grootte:</b> Aftuimel kieslys om die beeld grootte op die gedrukte "
"papier te beheer. Aftuimel werk in verbinding met glyer onder. Aftuimel opsies "
"is:.</p> "
"<ul>  "
"<li> <b>Natuurlike Beeld Grootte:</b> Beeld druk in sy natuurlike beeld "
"grootte. Indien dit nie op een vel inpas nie, sal die uitdruk versprei word oor "
"veelvuldige velle. Let daarop dat die glyer onaktief is wanneer 'n natuurlike "
"beeld grootte in die aftuimel kieslys geselekteer is. </li> "
"<li> <b>Resolusie (ppi):</b> Die resolusie waarde glyer dek 'n aantal reeks van "
"1 to 1200. Dit spesifiseer die resolusie van die beeld in Pixels Per Duim "
"(PPI). 'n Beeld wat 3000x2400 pixels is sal byvoorbeeld 10x8 duime tot 300 "
"pixels per duim druk, maar 5x4 duime tot 600 pixels per duim. Indien die "
"gespesifiseerde resolusie die beeeld groter maak as die bladsy, sal veelvuldige "
"bladsye gedruk word. Resolusie verstek tot 72 ppi. </li> "
"<li> <b>% van Bladsy Grootte:</b> Die persentasie waarde glyer dek getalle van "
"1 tto 800.  Dit spesifiseer die grootte in verhouding met die bladsy (nie die "
"beeld nie). 'n Skaal van 100 persent sal die bladsy vul so volledig as wat die "
"beeld aspek ratio dit toelaat (doen outo-rotasie van die beeld soos nodig). 'n "
"Skaal van meer as 100 sal die beeld oor veelvuldige bladsye druk. 'n Skaal van "
"200 persent sal tot 4 bladyse druk. </li> Skaal in % van bladsy grootte verstek "
"tot 100 %. "
"<li><b>% van Natuurlike Beeld Grootte:</b> Die persentasie waarde glyer beweeg "
"van 1 tot 800. Dit spesifiseer die uitdruk grootte in verhouding tot die "
"natuurlike beeld grootte. 'n Skaal van 100 persent sal die beeld in sy "
"natuurlike grootte druk, terwyl 'n skaal van 50 persent die beeld teen die "
"helfte van sy natuurlike grootte sal druk. Indien die gespesifiseerde skaal die "
"beeld groter maak as die bladsy, sal veelvuldige bladsye gedruk word. Skaal in "
"% van natuurlike beeld grootte verstek tot 100 %.  </ul>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Addisionele wenk vir krag gebruikers:</b> Hierdie KDEDdruk GUI "
"element stem ooreen met die CUPS opdraglyn opsie parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>     -o natuurlike-skaal=...     # reeks in  %  is 1....800  "
"<br>     -o skaal=...             # reeks in  %  is 1....800  "
"<br>     -o ppi=...                 # reeks in ppi is 1...1200  </pre> </p>  "
"</qt> "

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:192
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Position Preview Thumbnail</b></p>  "
"<p>This position preview thumbnail indicates the position of the image on the "
"paper sheet.  "
"<p>Click on horizontal and vertical radio buttons to move image alignment on "
"paper around. Options are:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> center      </li> "
"<li> top         </li> "
"<li> top-left    </li> "
"<li> left        </li> "
"<li> bottom-left </li> "
"<li> bottom      </li> "
"<li> bottom-right</li> "
"<li> right       </li> "
"<li> top-right   </li> </ul>  </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Posisie Voorskou Duimnaelskets</b></p>  "
"<p>Hierdie posisie voorskou duimnaelskets dui die posisie van die beeld op die "
"vel papier aan.  "
"<p>Kliek op horisontale en vertikale radio knoppies om die beeld se rigting op "
"papier rond te beweeg. Opsies is:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> sentreer      </li> "
"<li> bokant         </li> "
"<li> bo-links    </li> "
"<li> links        </li> "
"<li> boddem-links </li> "
"<li> boddem      </li> "
"<li> boddem-regs</li> "
"<li> regs       </li> "
"<li> bo-regs   </li> </ul>  </p>  </qt>"

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:210
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Reset to Default Values</b> </p>  "
"<p> Reset all coloration settings to default values. Default values are:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> Brightness: 100 </li> "
"<li> Hue (Tint).   0 </li> "
"<li> Saturation: 100 </li> "
"<li> Gamma:     1000 </li> </ul>  </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Herstel na Verstek Waardes</b> </p>  "
"<p> Herstel alle skaduwee instellings na verstek waardes. Verstek waardes is:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> Helderheid: 100 </li> "
"<li> Skakering (Tint).   0 </li> "
"<li> Saturasie: 100 </li> "
"<li> Gamma:     1000 </li> </ul>  </p>  </qt>"

#: cups/kpimagepage.cpp:222
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Image Positioning:</b></p>  "
"<p>Select a pair of radiobuttons to  move image to the position you want on the "
"paper printout. Default  is 'center'. </p>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element "
"matches  with the CUPS commandline job option parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o position=...       # examples: \"top-left\" or \"bottom\"  </pre> "
"</p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Beeld Positionering:</b></p>  "
"<p>Kies 'n paar radiouknoppies om beeld te skuif na die posisie wat jy op die "
"papier uitdruk wil hê. Verstek is 'Sentreer'. </p>  "
"<br>  "
"<hr>  "
"<p><em><b>Addisionele wenk vir krag gebruikers:</b> Hierdie KDEDruk GUI element "
" stem ooreen met die CUPS opdraglyn taak opsie parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>    -o posisie=...       # voorbeelde: \"top-links\" of \"onderkant\"  "
"</pre> </p>  </qt>"

