#: kpfilterpage.cpp:394
msgid ""
"<p>The filter chain is wrong. The output format of at least one filter is not "
"supported by its follower. See <b>Filters</b> tab for more information.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Die filtreer ketting is verkeerd. Die uitset formaat van ten minste een "
"filtreerder is nie ondersteund deur sy opvolger nie. Sien <b>Filtreerderss</b> "
"oortjie vir meer informasie.</p>"

#: kpfilterpage.cpp:408
msgid "Input"
msgstr "Inset"

#: kpqtpage.cpp:70
msgid ""
" <qt>  <b>Selection of color mode:</b> You can choose between 2 options:  "
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Color</b> and</li>  "
"<li><b>Grayscale</b></li></ul>  <b>Note:</b> This selection field may be grayed "
"out and made inactive.  This happens if KDEPrint can not retrieve  enough "
"information about your print file. In this case the embedded color- or "
"grayscale information  of your printfile, and the default handling of the "
"printer take precedence.  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  <b>Seleksie van kleur modus:</b> Jy kan tussen 2 opsies kies:  "
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Kleur</b> en</li>  "
"<li><b>Grysskaal</b></li></ul>  <b>Nota:</b> Hierdie seleksie veld kan "
"uitgegrys en onaktief gemaak word.  Dit gebeur wanneer KDEDruk nie genoeg "
"inligting kan herwin omtrent jou druk lêer nie. In hierdie geval neem die "
"ingebedde kleur- of grysskaal inligting van jou druklêer en die verstek "
"hantering van die drukker voorkeur.  </qt>"

#: kpqtpage.cpp:79
msgid ""
" <qt>  <b>Selection of page size:</b> Select paper size to be printed on from  "
"the drop-down menu.  "
"<p>The exact list of choices depends on the printer driver (\"PPD\") you have "
"installed.  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  <b>Keuse van bladsy grootte:</b> Kies die papier grootte waarop gedruk "
"moet word van die aftuimel-kieslys.  "
"<p>Die presiese lys van keuse hang af van die drukker drywer (\"PPD\") wat jy "
"installeer het.  </qt>"

#: kpqtpage.cpp:84
msgid ""
" <qt>  <b>Selection of pages per sheet:</b>  You can choose to print more than "
"one page onto each sheet of paper.  This is sometimes useful to save paper.  "
"<p><b>Note 1:</b> the page images get scaled down accordingly to print 2 or 4 "
"pages per sheet.  The page image does not get scaled if you print 1 page per "
"sheet (the default setting.).  "
"<p><b>Note 2:</b> If you select multiple pages per sheet here, the scaling and "
"re-arranging is done  by your printing system.  "
"<p><b>Note 3, regarding \"Other\":</b> You cannot really select <em>Other</em> "
"as the number of  pages to print on one sheet.\"Other\" is checkmarked here for "
"information purposes only.  "
"<p>To select 8, 9, 16 or other numbers of  pages per sheet:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> go to the tab headlined \"Filter\"</li> "
"<li> enable the <em>Multiple Pages per Sheet</em> filter </li> "
"<li> and configure it (bottom-most button on the right of the \"Filters\" tab). "
"</li> </ul> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  <b>Seleksie van bladsye per vel:</b>  Jy kan kies om meer as een bladsy "
"om elke vel papier te druk. Dit is soms nuttig om papier te spaar.  "
"<p><b>Nota 1:</b> die bladsy beeld word afgeskaal dienooreenkomstig om 2 of 4 "
"bladsye per vel te druk.  Die bladsy beeld word nie geskaal as jy 1 bladsy per "
"vel (die verstel verstelling) druk nie.  "
"<p><b>Nota 2:</b> As jy veelvuldige bladsye per vel hier kies, word die skaling "
"en herrangskikking deur jou drukker stelsel gedoen.  "
"<p><b>Nota 3, rakende \"Ander\":</b> Jy kan nie regtig <em>Ander</em> "
"kies as die aantal bladsye om op een vel te druk nie.\"Ander\" is hier gemerk "
"slegs vir informasie doeleindes.  "
"<p>Om  8, 9, 16 of ander aantal papiere per vel te kies:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> gaan na die oortjie genoem \"Filtreer\"</li> "
"<li> aktiveer die <em>Veelvuldige Bladsy per Vel</em> filtreerder </li> "
"<li> en konfigureer dit (Knoppie meeste aan die regterkant van die "
"\"Filtreerders\" oortjie). </li> </ul> </qt>"

#: kpqtpage.cpp:102
msgid ""
" <qt>  <b>Selection of image orientation:</b> Orientation of the printed  "
"pageimage on your paper is controlled by the radio buttons. By default,  the "
"orientation is <em>Portrait</em>  "
"<p>You can select 2 alternatives:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> <b>Portrait.</b>.Portrait is the default setting. </li>  "
"<li> <b>Landscape.</b> </li>  </ul>  The icon changes according to your "
"selection. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  <b>Keuse van prent orientasie:</b> Orientasie van die gedrukte "
"bladsybeeld op jou papier word beheer deur die radio knoppies. By verstek is "
"die orientasie <em>Portret</em>  "
"<p>Jy kan 2 alternatiewes kies:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li> <b>Portret.</b>.Portret is die verstek verstelling. </li>  "
"<li> <b>Landskap.</b> </li>  </ul>  Die ikoon verander volgens jou keuse. </qt>"

